ers of the Company was heldon Friday, 25th September, 2026 at 1030 Hrs., through Video Conferencing (VC) /Other Audio Visual Means (OAVM), in accordance with the MCA and SEBI Circulars,to transact the business as stated in the Notice dated 29th July, 2026 convening theAGM.In this regard, please find enclosed the Summary of the proceedings of the110th\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_25092026193710_AGM_Proceedings_2025-26.pdf"},{"date":"2026-09-25","subject":"Appointment","text":"Pursuant to Regulation 30 of SEBI (Listing Obligation & Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we hereby informed that the Comptroller & Auditor General of India vide its letter No./CA. V/ COY/CENTRAL GOVERNMENT,GRSE(1)/ 627 dated 08 Sep 2026 has appointed M/s. S K Agrawal and Co., Chartered Accountants LLP, Kolkata as Statutory Auditor for the Company, u/s 139(5) of the Companies Act,\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_25092026133119_Intimation_of_Appointment_of_Statutary_Auditor_for_FY_2026-27.pdf"},{"date":"2026-09-24","subject":"Trading Window","text":"Garden Reach Shipbuilders & Engineers Limited has informed the Exchange regarding the Trading Window closure pursuant to SEBI (Prohibition of Insider Trading) Regulations, 2015","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_24092026141136_Intimation_of_Trading_Window_Closure_for_Q2_2026_ended_30_Sep_2026.pdf"},{"date":"2026-09-21","subject":"Outcome of Board Meeting","text":"This disclosure is in continuation to the disclosure filed by the Company on 24 Aug 2026 regarding Capacity Expansion through three new facilities including Raichak.In terms of Regulation 30 and other applicable provisions of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, as amended, we wish to inform that the Board of Directors of\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_21092026182548_Corp_Ann__Outcome_of_423rd_Board_Meeting_-_Capex_in_Raichak_facility.pdf"},{"date":"2026-09-14","subject":"Record Date","text":"Garden Reach Shipbuilders & Engineers Limited has informed the Exchange that Record date for the purpose of Dividend is 18-Sep-2026.","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_14092026131604_Intimation_of_Record_Date_of_Dividend_GRSE.pdf"},{"date":"2026-09-04","subject":"Copy of Newspaper Publication","text":"Pursuant to Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we have enclosed herewith the newspaper clippings regarding completion of dispatch of the Notice of 110th Annual General Meeting of the Company and Annual Report for FY 2025-26 to the members of the Company.Copies of newspaper clippings are attached herewith.This is for your information and\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_04092026113352_Newspaper_Clippings_Advertisement_after_dispatch_of_Notice.pdf"},{"date":"2026-09-03","subject":"Record Date","text":"Garden Reach Shipbuilders & Engineers Limited has informed the Exchange that Record date for the purpose of Dividend is 18-Sep-2026.","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_03092026155552_Intimation_of_110th_AGM_2026_Book_Closure_and_Dividend_GRSE.pdf"},{"date":"2026-09-03","subject":"Shareholders meeting","text":"This is to inform that the 110th Annual General Meeting ( AGM ) of the Company will be held on Friday, 25th September, 2026 at 1030 hours through Video Conferencing ( VC )/ Other Audio-Visual Means ( OAVM ) to transact the businesses as set out in the AGM Notice dated 29th Jul 2026, in accordance with the applicable circulars issued by Ministry of Corporate Affairs and Securities and Exchange\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_03092026155200_Intimation_of_110th_AGM_2026_Book_Closure_and_Dividend_GRSE.pdf"},{"date":"2026-09-03","subject":"Press Release","text":"1. In terms of Regulation 30 and other applicable provisions of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we wish to inform you that, the Company has entered into the following Memorandum of Understandings (MoUs): (a) Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with DNV (Det Norske Veritas), a globally recognized Maritime organization\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_03092026094736_Corp_Ann_MoUs_signed_with_DNV_and_Damen_-_Reg_30.pdf"},{"date":"2026-09-01","subject":"Copy of Newspaper Publication","text":"Pursuant to Regulation 30 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we have enclosed herewith newspaper clippings containing information regarding 110th Annual General Meeting of the members of the Company which is scheduled to be held on Friday, 25 September 2026 at 10.30 a.m. through Video Conferencing (VC)/Other Audio Visual Means (OAVM).The Copies of\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_01092026161632_Advertisement_before_dispatch_of_Notice_and_AR_110_AGM.pdf"},{"date":"2026-08-24","subject":"Bagging/Receiving of orders/contracts","text":"In terms of Regulation 30 and other applicable provisions of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we wish to inform you that the Company has received order from West Bengal Tourism Development Corporation Limited (WBTDCL) on 24 Aug 2026 for Procurement of two (02) nos. 100Pax Electric Ferry at a contract price of Rs.45.02\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_24082026131738_Corp_Ann__Receipt_of_Order_from_WBTDCL.pdf"},{"date":"2026-08-24","subject":"Press Release","text":"In terms of Regulation 30 and other applicable provisions of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, as amended, we wish to inform you that the Company is undertaking capacity expansion initiatives at Raichak, Timber Pond facility -Shalimar and Damodar facility Khidderpore Docks to strengthen its indigenous shipbuilding\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_24082026102244_Corp_Ann__Press_Release_regarding_3_new_facilities.pdf"},{"date":"2026-08-11","subject":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","text":"Further to our Intimation Letter No. SECY/GRSE/BD-69/AM/01/26-27 dated 03 Aug 2026, we wish to inform that Conference Call was held on Thursday, 06 August, 2026 at 03.30 P.M. to discuss the Unaudited Financial Results of the Company for the Quarter ended 30th June, 2026 and road ahead.In this regard and pursuant to Regulation 30 read with Para A of Part A of Schedule III of the SEBI (Listing\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_11082026161819_Transcript_Investors_Analyst_Conference_Call_Q1_GRSE.pdf"},{"date":"2026-08-06","subject":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","text":"Further to our intimation letter no. SECY/GRSE/BD-69/AM/01/26-27 dated 03rd August, 2026, we wish to inform that Conference Call has been held on Thursday, 06th August, 2026 at 03.30 P.M. to discuss the Unaudited Financial Results of the Company for the Quarter ended 30th June, 2026 and road ahead.In this regard and pursuant to Regulation 30 and other applicable provisions of the SEBI (LODR)\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRSE_06082026174928_Con_Call_Audio_Q1_FY26-27.pdf"},{"date":"2026-08-04","subject":"General Updates","text":"In terms of Regulation 30 and other applicable provisions of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, we wish to inform you that the Company has received the Letter of Intent (LOI) for construction of One 15 T Bollard Pull Electric Battery Propulsion Tug including installation of shore charging infrastructure for KDS, SMPA\u2026","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/GRS